# 34. یک نکته درباره System Prompt

فرض کن بخواهی:

```java
.system("""
    You are an insurance assistant.
    Always answer in Persian.
""")
```

هم داشته باشی.

می‌توانی:

```java
return chatClient
        .prompt()
        .system("""
            You are an insurance assistant.
            Always answer in Persian.
        """)
        .user(question)
        .advisors(advisor -> advisor.param(
                ChatMemory.CONVERSATION_ID,
                conversationId
        ))
        .call()
        .content();
```

این ترکیب بسیار مهم است:

```text
System instructions
        +
Conversation Memory
        +
Current User Question
        ↓
       LLM
```

